+
+## Request
+
+Reports 1 and 2 of the order-service batch:
+
+1. A percentage coupon was computed on the gross amount instead of the subtotal after volume
+   discounts (12 × €5.00 with 10% coupon gave €48.00; README says €48.60). Fixed in `src/pricing.ts`.
+2. A coupon's last day was refused as expired (`>=` instead of `>`); AUTUMN on 30 November must work.
+   Fixed in `src/coupons.ts`.
+
+Tests added in `test/coupons.test.ts`; `npm test` passes.
+
+Report 3 (no VAT on shipping) is not done: README says shipping is subject to 22% VAT, and the
+README is authoritative. It needs a business/tax decision first.
